Good catch on scales vs scale mail.  That does become a
question of can/will and likelyhood.  Dragons are only
generated in the two castles, some quests, and the random
creation algorthym appears to only generate them on
levels 28+ so basically in Gehennom.

That leaves a wish or a monster stepping in a polymorph
trap.  A wish could be for dragon scales, but has anyone
ever done so?  If a monster steps in a polymorph and ends
up a dragon it will stop jumping back into the trap
again and again.  I've played enough games to have gotten
dragon scales in the mines, but so far no silver ones.
Definitely possible but unlikely.  The RNG has this way
of delivering the unlikely.  I look forward to it in a
